Arbayeen Asth Arbayeen Asth Aayi Khuda<br>
<br>
Zainab Anda'ad Karbala Asth Aayi Khuda<br>
<br>
Bar Sare Qabr E Biradar Chun Raseed<br>
<br>
Nala O Aah O Fugaan Az Dil Kasheed<br>
<br>
1. As Salam Aye Kushta E Raah E Khuda<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Noor E Chashme Mustafa<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Shah E Bi Ghusl O Kafan<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Khust'ae Az Dil Watan<br>
<br>
2. As Salam Aye Tashna E Aab E Furaat<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Kashti E Behre Najaat<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Syed O Salar O Maa<br>
<br>
As Salam Aye Monis E Gham Khar O Maa